    "answer": {
      "short": "$-\\frac32\\le x\\le-\\frac12$ or $\\frac32\\le x\\le\\frac52$.",
      "worked": "Dividing by $2$ gives $1\\le\\left|x-\\frac12\\right|\\le2$.\n\nThe distance of $x$ from $\\frac12$ is between $1$ and $2$ units, inclusive. Moving left or right from the centre gives\n\n$$-\\frac32\\le x\\le-\\frac12\\quad\\text{or}\\quad\\frac32\\le x\\le\\frac52.$$",
